      <title>星辰的两种书写：张纯如原盘与假设盘的对读——从冥王处女到火星双鱼，从穀神天蝎到月木双子</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2026/04/%E6%98%9F%E8%BE%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E4%B9%A6%E5%86%99%E5%BC%A0%E7%BA%AF%E5%A6%82%E5%8E%9F%E7%9B%98%E4%B8%8E%E5%81%87%E8%AE%BE%E7%9B%98%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%BB%E4%BB%8E%E5%86%A5%E7%8E%8B%E5%A4%84%E5%A5%B3%E5%88%B0%E7%81%AB%E6%98%9F%E5%8F%8C%E9%B1%BC%E4%BB%8E%E7%A9%80%E7%A5%9E%E5%A4%A9%E8%9D%8E%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%88%E6%9C%A8%E5%8F%8C%E5%AD%90/</link>
